{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54427","headline":"蜀葵花 · 崔致远","name":"蜀葵花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞荒田侧，繁花压柔枝。\n香轻梅雨歇，影带麦风欹。\n车马谁见赏，蜂蝶徒相窥。\n自惭生地贱，堪恨人弃遗。\n（同前。\n以上五首皆录自《中央民族学院学报》一九八五年第一期刊金东勳《晚唐着名诗人崔致远》一文）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}